[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the car on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K41</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the band and disconnect the the turbocharger air inlet\nsleeve from the rigid pipe, air flow  meter side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065770.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585262\">7210E22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584917\">5520C20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584497\">1060G50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the protection (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021821.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Loosen the band (1a) and disconnect the flexible hose (1b) from\nthe air intake.</p><p>2. Remove the air filter (2a) complete with air flow meter (2b)\nby releasing from the underlying pins and then from the rear fastening.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a) and (1b) from the\ndiesel electronic injection system control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M10A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M10B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo nut (2a) and disconnect earth lead (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Earth on engine</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">C60</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021822.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the fastening clips and remove the\ncover from the engine compartment junction box.</p><p>1. Undo the nut and disconnect the positive supply lead in the engine\ncompartment junction box.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Using a screwdriver, remove the safety pin and disconnect the\nelectrical connections (2a) and (2b) from the engine compartment\njunction box.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Front/engine coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D4A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Front/engine coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D4B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Release the retaining clip and remove the spark plugs fuse block\n(MAXI FUSE) from the engine compartment junction box.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Spark plugs (MAXI FUSE) fuse</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B37</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065772.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) securing  cable duct (1b).</p><p>2. Withdraw the wiring complete with electrical connections from\nthe engine bay bulkhead.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021823.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Rotate the engine compartment junction unit on its hinges.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine compartment\njunction unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1F</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065773.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N70</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021824.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the pre-heating control\nunit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs controlunit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M15</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065774.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584493\">1060F50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584506\">1080C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584498\">1060G70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the excess pressure\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Turbocharging sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K82</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021825.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection joining the engine/radiator\nprewiring cables.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine cables/radiator cable coupling</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">D28</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065775.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K41</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021826.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K83</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065776.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021827.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the intake air pressure\nsensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Turbocharging sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K82</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065777.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the turbocharger vane\nactuator solenoid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021828.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine coolant\ntemperature sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Data not available yet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the rpm sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K46</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065778.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K83</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021829.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the engine oil pressure\nwarning light switch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections from the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A40</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N70</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Disconnect the electrical connection from the cam angle sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K47</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air conditioning\ncompressor engagement electromagnet.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot;\nelectromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L20</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Undo the bolts securing the cable pass to the cylinder head.</p><p>7. Release the system cable loom (7a) from the attachments (7b)\nand move it aside.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065779.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure regulator\non the fuel pump.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure regulator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N77</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the cam angle sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K47</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection from the solenoid on the\nvacuum tank.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Butterfly casing solenoid valve</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L62</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021830.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the fuel pressure regulator.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fuel pressure regulator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">N77</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection from the E.G.R. valve.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>EGR solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">L30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065780.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and disconnect supply lead (1b) from the fuse/relay\nbox.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the fuse/relay box cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021831.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a) and (1b) from the\ndiesel electronic injection system control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M10A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M10B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065781.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Raise the fuse/relay box (1a) and diconnect the electrical connection\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Engine compartment junction unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">B1F</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect e