harger,\nair flow meter side, and tighten the fixing band.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K41</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Carry out \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584157\">1008A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Fit tool (1a) to the pressure pump mount and secure with nuts\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.625.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit  tool (2a), complete with support blocks (2b) and connect\nto the bracket fitted previously using link (2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Crossmember</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.595.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Support mountings</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.650.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the hydraulic lift from beneath\nthe power unit.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The above operations must be carried\nout in order to remove the air conditioner electrical connection.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021836.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the system cable loom.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the system wiring harness in its seat.</p><p>Position the hydraulic lift beneath the\npower unit.</p><p>Remove the safety tools used for supporting\nthe power unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Crossmember</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.595.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Support mountings</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.650.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Mount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.625.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584157\">1008A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine oil pressure warning light switch.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nalternator.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nstarter motor.</p><p>Refit the bracket, then connect the rpm\nsensor electrical connection.</p><p>Place the engine oil dipstick tube assembly\nback in its housing and secure.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to  the\nair conditioning compressor electromagnet coupling.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\nrefit together with the fuse.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nfuse/relay box and place it back in its housing.</p><p>Refit the fuse/relay box cover in its seat.</p><p>Connect the fuse/relay box supply lead\nand tighten the nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nsolenoid on the vacuum tank.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\npressure regulator on  the pressure pump.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nfuel pressure sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nturbocharger vane actuator solenoid.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nexcess pressure sensor.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584498\">1060G70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584506\">1080C24</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584493\">1060F50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ninjectors.</p><p>Fit the wiring with electrical connections\nfor the diesel electronic injection system through the tunnel in\nthe engine bulkhead.</p><p>Tighten the cable duct nuts.</p><p>Connect the earth lead and fix it using\nthe nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\ndiesel electronic injection control unit.</p><p>Place the protection back in its housing\nand fix it using the nuts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584497\">1060G50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584917\">5520C20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585262\">7210E22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]